SlateportCity_OceanicMuseum_2F_Text_ThankYouForTheParts:
	.string "Yes? If you're looking for STERN, that's\n"
	.string "me.\p"
	.string "Ah! The parts I ordered from MR. STONE\n"
	.string "of DEVON!\p"
	.string "Thank you! Now we can prepare our\n"
	.string "expedition!$"

SlateportCity_OceanicMuseum_2F_Text_WellTakeThoseParts:
	.string "Hehehe, hold it! We'll take those parts!\n"
	.string "For the bottling plant!$"

SlateportCity_OceanicMuseum_2F_Text_SternWhoAreYou:
	.string "CAPT. STERN: Wh-what? Who are you\n"
	.string "people? Is this about the parking\l"
	.string "ticket?$"

SlateportCity_OceanicMuseum_2F_Text_WereTeamAqua:
	.string "We're TEAM AQUA!\p"
	.string "The BOSS wants those parts! Fork them\n"
	.string "over, or no bubbles for you!$"

SlateportCity_OceanicMuseum_2F_Text_Grunt1Defeat:
	.string "Awaaaah! My fizz went flat!$"

SlateportCity_OceanicMuseum_2F_Text_BossGoingToBeFurious:
	.string "Oh, man… The BOSS is going to be\n"
	.string "furious…\p"
	.string "No bubbles for a week…$"

SlateportCity_OceanicMuseum_2F_Text_LetMeTakeCareOfThis:
	.string "Humph, flat-water wimp! Let me handle\n"
	.string "this!$"

SlateportCity_OceanicMuseum_2F_Text_Grunt2Defeat:
	.string "What?! I lost too!\p"
	.string "Pour me a SPA!$"

SlateportCity_OceanicMuseum_2F_Text_MeddlingKid:
	.string "If we don't get the parts, we're in for\n"
	.string "it!\p"
	.string "Meddling kid!$"

SlateportCity_OceanicMuseum_2F_Text_CameToSeeWhatsTakingSoLong:
	.string "What's taking so long?\p"
	.string "Held up by a child? You're all flat.$"

SlateportCity_OceanicMuseum_2F_Text_ArchieWarning:
	.string "We are TEAM AQUA, and we love bubbles!\p"
	.string "I am ARCHIE. Founder of AQUA SPARKLING\n"
	.string "WATER.\p"
	.string "You're not MAGMA? You don't smell like\n"
	.string "chili.\p"
	.string "… … … … … …\p"
	.string "All life depends on water. But still\n"
	.string "water is boring.\p"
	.string "So I'll carbonate the sea, with the\n"
	.string "ultimate bottling plant: KYOGRE.\p"
	.string "Fwahaha! Interfere again and I'll bill\n"
	.string "you. Per bubble.$"

SlateportCity_OceanicMuseum_2F_Text_SternThankYouForSavingUs:
	.string "CAPT. STERN: You're… Ah, right, {PLAYER}{KUN}…\p"
	.string "That was tense! Thank you for saving\n"
	.string "us!\p"
	.string "Oh, and you even brought the parts from\n"
	.string "DEVON!$"

SlateportCity_OceanicMuseum_2F_Text_SternIveGotToGo:
	.string "CAPT. STERN: Whoops! No time to lose!\p"
	.string "We're setting out on our ocean-floor\n"
	.string "expedition soon.\p"
	.string "Thanks again, but I've got to go!\p"
	.string "Feel free to look around. Don't lick the\n"
	.string "exhibits.$"

SlateportCity_OceanicMuseum_2F_Text_RemindsMeOfAbandonedShip:
	.string "I saw a model ship here.\p"
	.string "It reminds me of the ABANDONED SHIP\n"
	.string "near DEWFORD.\p"
	.string "I was on it. When it wasn't abandoned\n"
	.string "yet.$"

SlateportCity_OceanicMuseum_2F_Text_DontRunInMuseum:
	.string "Don't you dare run in the MUSEUM!\p"
	.string "Walk. Briskly. Like an adult.$"

SlateportCity_OceanicMuseum_2F_Text_WantToRideSubmarine:
	.string "The submarine is awesome! Can it turn\n"
	.string "into a giant robot? GET IN THE ROBOT!$"

SlateportCity_OceanicMuseum_2F_Text_WaterQualitySample1:
	.string "“WATER QUALITY SAMPLE 1,” the label\n"
	.string "says.\p"
	.string "The sea is all connected, but the water\n"
	.string "seems to differ by region.\p"
	.string "…Tastes still. TEAM AQUA disapproves.$"

SlateportCity_OceanicMuseum_2F_Text_WaterQualitySample2:
	.string "“WATER QUALITY SAMPLE 2,” the label\n"
	.string "says.\p"
	.string "It tastes different from sample 1. …Why\n"
	.string "did you taste it?$"

SlateportCity_OceanicMuseum_2F_Text_PressureExperiment:
	.string "A rubber ball is expanding and\n"
	.string "shrinking.\p"
	.string "“In the sea, the water itself exerts\n"
	.string "pressure.\p"
	.string "“In shallow water, not much.\p"
	.string "“In very deep water, tens of thousands\n"
	.string "of tons press on a small area.”\p"
	.string "Kind of like exam week.$"

SlateportCity_OceanicMuseum_2F_Text_HoennModel:
	.string "“MODEL OF HOENN REGION”\p"
	.string "It's a miniature diorama of the HOENN\n"
	.string "region.\p"
	.string "Where is LITTLEROOT TOWN? … There. The\n"
	.string "boring bit.$"

SlateportCity_OceanicMuseum_2F_Text_DeepSeawaterDisplay:
	.string "A display on the flow of seawater.\p"
	.string "“Near the seabed, water flows due to\n"
	.string "differences in temperature and\l"
	.string "saltiness.”$"

SlateportCity_OceanicMuseum_2F_Text_SurfaceSeawaterDisplay:
	.string "A display on the flow of seawater.\p"
	.string "“Near the surface, currents are driven\n"
	.string "by the wind.” And by TENTACOOL. Lots of\l"
	.string "TENTACOOL.$"

SlateportCity_OceanicMuseum_2F_Text_SSTidalReplica:
	.string "“THE FERRY S.S. TIDAL\p"
	.string "“A scale model of the ship being built\n"
	.string "at STERN'S SHIPYARD.”$"

SlateportCity_OceanicMuseum_2F_Text_SubmarineReplica:
	.string "“SUBMARINE EXPLORER 1\p"
	.string "“A replica of the high-performance\n"
	.string "seafloor submarine.” Please do not\l"
	.string "steal.$"

SlateportCity_OceanicMuseum_2F_Text_SumbersibleReplica:
	.string "“SUBMERSIBLE POD\p"
	.string "“A replica of a small, unmanned pod for\n"
	.string "seafloor exploration.”$"

SlateportCity_OceanicMuseum_2F_Text_SSAnneReplica:
	.string "“S.S. ANNE\p"
	.string "“A replica of the luxury liner that\n"
	.string "circles the globe.”\p"
	.string "There's a tiny truck next to it. Weird.$"
